#   X51005433541 conflicting_total (rejects kept in meta.alternatives)
#   X51005433533 deskew 7.8deg (robustness / rotation)
#   X51005268408 near-unreadable (low_mean_ocr_conf + 4 flags)
#   X51005705760 cross-check catches CHANGE mistaken for total
